RK_DEV_SETUP_STEPS      # rk and git-cliff come from the project's development environment,
      # through the prefix the project records, so the environment must carry
      # rk, git-cliff at the version versions.toml pins, which rk checks
      # before it writes anything, and for a python project the uv the
      # project requires (release-engine:git-cliff-runs-at-its-pin).
